8-.833 24.669-18.954L5 100l29.319-10.403-24.67-18.954 31.1-.833-17.606-25.65 29.834 8.817-8.817-29.834 25.65 17.605.833-31.098 18.954 24.669z\"></path></svg><div class=\"mx-auto w-container max-w-full py-16 lg:py-[100px]\"><h2 class=\"sm:mb-20 mb-14 text-center\">Loved by the community</h2><div class=\"grid-cols-1 grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-0 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"group flex flex-col justify-center\"><div class=\"min-h-20 sm:w-[500px] w-full mx-auto mb-4 lg:min-h-48 lg:mb-8 lg:w-full rounded-base border-2 border-border bg-background p-5 shadow-shadow\"><div class=\"flex items-center sm:gap-5 gap-3\"><img class=\"size-10 sm:size-12 rounded-base border-2 border-border\" alt=\"pfp\" src=\"./Neobrutalism components - Start making neobrutalism layouts today_files/90.1c0f5474.jpg\"><div><h4 class=\"sm:text-lg text-base font-heading\">Willis Cummings</h4><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm \">Forward Accountability Liaison</p></div></div><div class=\"sm:mt-5 mt-3 sm:text-base text-sm break-words\">This library is complete garbage.</div></div><div class=\"min-h-20 sm:w-[500px] w-full mx-auto mb-4 lg:min-h-48 lg:mb-8 lg:w-full rounded-base border-2 border-border bg-background p-5 shadow-shadow\"><div class=\"flex items-center sm:gap-5 gap-3\"><img class=\"size-10 sm:size-12 rounded-base border-2 border-border\" alt=\"pfp\" src=\"./Neobrutalism components - Start making neobrutalism layouts today_files/17.1cc8049e.jpg\"><div><h4 class=\"sm:text-lg text-base font-heading\">Lillie Green</h4><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm \">Global Factors Producer</p></div></div><div class=\"sm:mt-5 mt-3 sm:text-base text-sm break-words\">I don't believe there are people who will actually use this lmao.</div></div></div><div class=\"group flex flex-col justify-center\"><div class=\"min-h-20 sm:w-[500px] w-full mx-auto mb-4 lg:min-h-48 lg:mb-8 lg:w-full rounded-base border-2 border-border bg-background p-5 shadow-shadow\"><div class=\"flex items-center sm:gap-5 gap-3\"><img class=\"size-10 sm:size-12 rounded-base border-2 border-border\" alt=\"pfp\" src=\"./Neobrutalism components - Start making neobrutalism layouts today_files/20.63a76cdf.jpg\"><div><h4 class=\"sm:text-lg text-base font-heading\">Mr. Ignacio Beier</h4><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm \">International Quality Executive</p></div></div><div class=\"sm:mt-5 mt-3 sm:text-base text-sm break-words\">This \u201ctheme\u201d frankly sucks. Unbelievable somebody actually spent time on this.</div></div><div class=\"min-h-20 sm:w-[500px] w-full mx-auto mb-4 lg:min-h-48 lg:mb-8 lg:w-full rounded-base border-2 border-border bg-background p-5 shadow-shadow\"><div class=\"flex items-center sm:gap-5 gap-3\"><img class=\"size-10 sm:size-12 rounded-base border-2 border-border\" alt=\"pfp\" src=\"./Neobrutalism components - Start making neobrutalism layouts today_files/26.e8d42a1f.jpg\"><div><h4 class=\"sm:text-lg text-base font-heading\">Megan Franey</h4><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm \">Customer Web Analyst</p></div></div><div class=\"sm:mt-5 mt-3 sm:text-base text-sm break-words\">If you want to reduce your conversion rate to 0, then this ui library is perfect for you.</div></div><div class=\"min-h-20 sm:w-[500px] w-full mx-auto mb-4 lg:min-h-48 lg:mb-8 lg:w-full rounded-base border-2 border-border bg-background p-5 shadow-shadow\"><div class=\"flex items-center sm:gap-5 gap-3\"><img class=\"size-10 sm:size-12 rounded-base border-2 border-border\" alt=\"pfp\" src=\"./Neobrutalism components - Start making neobrutalism layouts today_files/35.de994a4f.jpg\"><div><h4 class=\"sm:text-lg text-base font-heading\">Caleb Jaskolski V</h4><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm \">Global Research Planner</p></div></div><div class=\"sm:mt-5 mt-3 sm:text-base text-sm break-words\">I thought Material UI was worst looking ui library.</div></div></div><div class=\"group flex flex-col justify-center\"><div class=\"min-h-20 sm:w-[500px] w-full mx-auto mb-4 lg:min-h-48 lg:mb-8 lg:w-full rounded-base border-2 border-border bg-background p-5 shadow-shadow\"><div class=\"flex items-center sm:gap-5 gap-3\"><img class=\"size-10 sm:size-12 rounded-base border-2 border-border\" alt=\"pfp\" src=\"./Neobrutalism components - Start making neobrutalism layouts today_files/76.6a0b069b.jpg\"><div><h4 class=\"sm:text-lg text-base font-heading\">John Doe</h4><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm \">National Brand Facilitator</p></div></div><div class=\"sm:mt-5 mt-3 sm:text-base text-sm break-words\">I want to vomit.</div></div><div class=\"min-h-20 sm:w-[500px] w-full mx-auto mb-4 lg:min-h-48 lg:mb-8 lg:w-full rounded-base border-2 border-border bg-background p-5 shadow-shadow\"><div class=\"flex items-center sm:gap-5 gap-3\"><img class=\"size-10 sm:size-12 rounded-base border-2 border-border\" alt=\"pfp\" src=\"./Neobrutalism components - Start making neobrutalism layouts today_files/80.49b19a85.jpg\"><div><h4 class=\"sm:text-lg text-base font-heading\">Mr. Pedro Carroll</h4><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm \">Legacy Optimization Supervisor</p></div></div><div class=\"sm:mt-5 mt-3 sm:text-base text-sm break-words\">HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAH IMAGINE USING THIS.</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"border-t-4 z-0 border-t-border border-b-4 border-b-border bg-background py-16 lg:py-[100px]\"><h2 class=\"sm:mb-20 mb-14 px-5 text-center\">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class=\"mx-auto not-prose grid w-[700px] max-w-full px-5\"><div data-slot=\"accordion\" class=\"text-base sm:text-lg\" data-orientation=\"vertical\"><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-slot=\"accordion-item\" class=\"rounded-base overflow-hidden border-2 border-b border-border shadow-shadow mb-2\"><h3 data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\" class=\"flex\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-\u00abr1s\u00bb\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-\u00abr1r\u00bb\" data-slot=\"accordion-trigger\" class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between text-